          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Critical Success",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The cult’s messaging resonates spectacularly! The cult gains 2d4+4 Recruitment Points.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Success",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The cult’s efforts result in a steady stream of new recruits. The cult gains 2d4 Recruitment Points.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Failure",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " The evangelism changes few minds, earning the cult only 1d4 Recruitment Points.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": "Critical Failure",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " Whether due to pushy apostles, poor messaging, or unintended scandals, recent evangelism disillusions followers. The cult loses 1d4 Recruitment Points.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
